+## Check 17: Post-Merge Deploy + Re-Enqueue Sweep (STORY-800)
+
+**Purpose:** After a merge to `main` touching `deployment/hermes/` or `deployment/morris/` paths,
+automatically deploy the fix to all agent VMs and re-enqueue any dispatch_items that failed
+due to the now-fixed bug. Replaces the manual shepherd loop (canonical incident: 2026-04-29,
+STORY-759 merge → 11 stuck `api-retail-target` stories, ~1h of manual work by Mark).
+
+**Invocation:** Called from this skill's heartbeat cycle whenever a new merge is detected.
+Does nothing (no-op) when no new merges touch agent-VM paths since last run.
+
+**Script:** `deployment/morris/scripts/post-merge-sweep.py`
+
+**State file:** `/home/hermes/state/morris/last-fleet-vigilance-merge-sweep.txt`
+(two lines: `<40-char SHA>` + `<ISO-8601 timestamp>`)
+
+**Command:**
+```bash
+python3 /home/hermes/dev/tech-dev-agents/deployment/morris/scripts/post-merge-sweep.py
+```
+
+**Flow:**
+1. Read state file for last-processed merge SHA + timestamp.
+2. Run `git log --since=<last_ts> --pretty=format:%H -- deployment/hermes/ deployment/morris/`
+   (no `--no-merges` — PRs land as merge commits in this repo).
+3. If no new merges: no-op, exit 0.
+4. For each new merge SHA:
+   a. Run `deployment/vm/push-code.sh` (timeout 900s).
+   b. If smoke failure: send `[CRIT]` Teams DM, log to fleet-health.md, STOP (do not re-enqueue).
+   c. Query `GET /api/dispatch/history?status=failed&lookback_hours=<N>` for eligible rows.
+   d. For non-terminal rows (paused/claimed): DELETE cancel first, then POST re-enqueue.
+   e. For terminal rows (failed): POST re-enqueue directly.
+   f. Send `[FLEET-SWEEP]` summary Teams DM.
+   g. Append `[POST-MERGE-SWEEP]` line to fleet-health.md.
+   h. Write new SHA + timestamp to state file.
+
+**Severity / DM:**
+- **OK** (no new merges): silent.
+- **OK** (merges deployed + re-enqueued): `[FLEET-SWEEP]` summary DM to Mark.
+- **CRIT** (smoke failure): `[CRIT]` DM to Mark; re-enqueue blocked until next successful deploy.
+
+**Env vars (see `state/morris/SETUP-CHECKLIST.md`):**
+- `OPS_CONSOLE_API_KEY` (required — raises ValueError if unset)
+- `OPS_CONSOLE_BASE_URL` (default: `http://localhost:8005`)
+- `FLEET_SWEEP_LOOKBACK_HOURS` (default: 24)
+- `MARK_TEAMS_CHAT_ID` (required for DM delivery)
+- `MORRIS_GRAPH_TOKEN` (required for DM delivery)
+
+**Bootstrap (first run):** If the state file does not exist, the script reads `git rev-parse HEAD`,
+writes that SHA + current timestamp to the state file, and exits with no deploys/re-enqueues.
+This prevents a full-history scan (`--since=1970`) on first invocation.
+
+**Disable:** Remove the Check 17 invocation from this SKILL.md, or `chmod -x` the script.
+
